{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>龔慈恩女兒林愷鈴（Ashley）早前憑ViuTV劇集《地獄大狀》人氣急升，近日更親口承認擁有滿清皇族血統！不過，除了她的「格格」身世及爸爸林煒撞樣許光漢翻Hit外，全網焦點竟然落在她極為低調的23歲弟弟林卓毅（Addison）身上。這位身高達190cm的法律系頂級學霸，不但文武雙全，早年更為甄子丹愛女甄濟如MV做男主角，被網民狂讚「一家人顏值嚴重超標」！</p><figure><img alt=\"已入行發展。（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821093561044992763845.jpeg/404Y01CcwesH-OmAm-Jec-35Twsxbreiwh0T1sIdE9Y\"/><figcaption>已入行發展。（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"有「最美星二代」的美譽。（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821220803645440134086.jpeg/M2ak6NemX7fXjYBT6AsWLymw6MIr5pHZmQbV5pkG1eY\"/><figcaption>有「最美星二代」的美譽。（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"林愷鈴有「最美星二代」的美譽。（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194415761666609152146952.png/EED0SqGNTmKu3AHR1iWJsRdlTWLr3ByDEySC8xMkgvM\"/><figcaption>林愷鈴有「最美星二代」的美譽。（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龔慈恩女兒林愷鈴（Ashley）早前憑ViuTV劇集《地獄大狀》人氣急升。（劇照）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194415756977115136082653.png/TkA11c1ttE5FQjXb1wQa9zTxpm3iP7009wCulvcArpY\"/><figcaption>龔慈恩女兒林愷鈴（Ashley）早前憑ViuTV劇集《地獄大狀》人氣急升。（劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大女林愷鈴（Ashley）遺傳了父母的優良基因，外形出眾。（IG@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821095750602752137064.jpeg/--yBAnlEuMdVqAoBOp3n2kRuGw8fQvFewZFWOcGRVjk\"/><figcaption>大女林愷鈴（Ashley）遺傳了父母的優良基因，外形出眾。（IG@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龔慈恩Keep得好好。（IG@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875820277874298880165392.jpeg/7ljjTjq_V5OJifhINmSobzUHgicNspdG9NB2fvTQdn4\"/><figcaption>龔慈恩Keep得好好。（IG@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><p>認愛新覺羅後裔　爸爸舊劇翻Hit撞樣許光漢</p><p>林愷鈴近日受訪時證實，其父親林煒的外祖父（即林愷鈴的太外公）是末代皇帝溥儀的堂兄弟，是不折不扣的皇族後裔。她坦言：「對我哋嘅祖先都好Respect嘅，冇佢哋就冇我哋，細個聽過嫲嫲講過，佢係姓愛新覺羅。」她更笑言如果有機會，極想挑戰清裝劇。</p><p>除了皇族血統掀起熱議，林愷鈴爸爸林煒早年主演的經典台劇《我永遠愛你》近日亦在Threads引發「考古熱」。台灣網民驚嘆90年代的林煒五官精緻，眉宇間竟極度神似現今亞洲男神許光漢。對於爸爸舊片迎來「文藝復興」，林愷鈴笑逐顏開表示：「爸爸嘅顏值加埋劇情夠激，台灣網民真係好識寫嘢，氹到我哋好開心！」</p><figure><img alt=\"林愷鈴（Ashley）的57歲父親、龔慈恩前夫林煒，近日突然在社交平台Threads掀起一波「文藝復興」！（龔慈恩微博）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194362240430510080549738.jpeg/9S0q5nCwTJyfj4GN7E5a9KO2MpJSThGxEZmC_hGZgv4\"/><figcaption>林愷鈴（Ashley）的57歲父親、龔慈恩前夫林煒，近日突然在社交平台Threads掀起一波「文藝復興」！（龔慈恩微博）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事緣有網民翻出他昔日主演台劇的經典片段，驚覺年輕時的他五官俊俏，獲封為「上古許光漢」。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194355945061617664164258.jpeg/OMGeV03Hmx3SQy4IBcVWIipyNO_9wUzM8PEG-vDxBvo\"/><figcaption>事緣有網民翻出他昔日主演台劇的經典片段，驚覺年輕時的他五官俊俏，獲封為「上古許光漢」。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"事緣有網民翻出他昔日主演台劇的經典片段，驚覺年輕時的他五官俊俏，獲封為「上古許光漢」。（民視截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194355943773704192304529.jpeg/eRTgUNHpznWrdS7r83oXCr6aD32Hqjth8zVqDPM1agw\"/><figcaption>事緣有網民翻出他昔日主演台劇的經典片段，驚覺年輕時的他五官俊俏，獲封為「上古許光漢」。（民視截圖）</figcaption></figure><p>190cm胞弟登熱搜　克服活躍症變全能學霸</p><p>隨著林家「神仙基因」被全網瘋傳，極少公開露面的23歲弟弟林卓毅（Addison）亦連帶爆紅。身高達190cm的Addison身形高大，極具韓系男神風範。大批網民翻出他的生活照後驚呼連連，紛紛大讚：「老竇似許光漢，個仔都咁正」、「成家人顏值嚴重超標」、「林家基因真係太強大」，令他一夜之間登上熱搜。</p><p>Addison的條件可謂得天獨厚，雖然童年時曾被診斷患有輕微過度活躍症，但他現時不僅精通小提琴及色士風，更曾是校內欖球隊主力及熱愛打籃球，甚至多次在粵語朗誦比賽中奪冠，絕對是文武雙全。學歷方面更非常猛料，他中學時入讀每年學費逾50萬港元的加拿大頂尖貴族寄宿名校Appleby College，畢業後遠赴英國名牌大學攻讀法律，是內外兼備的頂級尖子。</p><figure><img alt=\"細細個已經好靚女。（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875820275307253760794286.jpeg/b3Z3AT-uSySDGqs6jzGJELz-3lz6Z58z5tPrJ-bT6yc\"/><figcaption>細細個已經好靚女。（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"兩姊弟在單親家庭中長大。（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194415437341790208768129.png/t04Nt4wq0hYAx1OifwtNuCNKkjd6LyyOSa4D0kmuA9I\"/><figcaption>兩姊弟在單親家庭中長大。（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"一家三口去睇音樂劇。（IG@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875820268075880448491632.jpeg/c9bvxvAWczvc70-CEejM6wCT6sRXm3kzBinXEAYp1xA\"/><figcaption>一家三口去睇音樂劇。（IG@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"高大靚仔！（IG@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875820270399655936108247.jpeg/yAP-kaDlYNxeZ22OmKSKpqD-dXO9HL_E83grufN4K7k\"/><figcaption>高大靚仔！（IG@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"顏值高。（IG@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194418450651549696902761.jpeg/3FcUxDQs2ZiM4hm7RWI-6y_4nxOU-8GrN5A65jeQOuY\"/><figcaption>顏值高。（IG@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"被指似韓星。（微博@龔慈恩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194418448399077376196273.jpeg/3XlD-7IgHd-OLleJUt7EkR4QPIfwdhbpIFd1aiBXdWo\"/><figcaption>被指似韓星。（微博@龔慈恩）</figcaption></figure><p>拍甄子丹大女MV 拒做紅娘：最緊要佢開心</p><p>外形出眾的Addison早前已悄悄半隻腳踏入娛樂圈，在宇宙最強甄子丹長女甄濟如（Jasmine）2024年推出的《次次》MV中擔正做男主角。被問到弟弟是否有意入行，林愷鈴表示未有直接問過對方，但相信會持開放態度。</p><p>對於弟弟首個MV獻給了自己的好朋友，林愷鈴大讚兩人年紀相若十分可愛。至於會否順勢做紅娘撮合兩人？她即笑著落閘：「又冇呢個諗法，本身我同Jasmine係好朋友……我又冇呢個能力，最緊要佢開心。」她亦透露兩姊弟從小就喜歡一起做Project，期望將來有機會可以一齊夾歌合作。</p><figure><img alt=\"Addison曾做甄濟如歌曲MV男主角。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261103/1194418310683299840857096.jpeg/74cv2Toa5fUPJlvmgLNpb1mZ8RSgG50mdFGfPnRRnz4\"/><figcaption>Addison曾做甄濟如歌曲MV男主角。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龔慈恩細仔林卓毅高大靚仔，仲係學霸。（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210622/484056396371857408718639.jpeg/xjETZG19ufDdqoVfQWUjtGo4MriXxdfWzmDPds5gz3Y\"/><figcaption>龔慈恩細仔林卓毅高大靚仔，仲係學霸。（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"龔慈恩曾帶埋一對仔女同曾華倩飯敘。（IG@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821438576234496476059.jpeg/MZQPlreTyM-270k0a91zHyOiypf6QCy1jIe6FIyHuhQ\"/><figcaption>龔慈恩曾帶埋一對仔女同曾華倩飯敘。（IG@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"品學兼優。（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821436411842560536184.jpeg/yWfnO7s_bxJTZqRN2U1iTx6E6F3xvpmghQdKpIUHSqQ\"/><figcaption>品學兼優。（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2022年7月出席《七人樂隊》特別場。（微博@龔慈恩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821953309478912234756.jpeg/IxBoXSOWcJBVVNm1fvsbETd65XOBEcXWvTf3170399c\"/><figcaption>2022年7月出席《七人樂隊》特別場。（微博@龔慈恩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"2022年7月出席《七人樂隊》特別場。（微博@龔慈恩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875822056933953536214630.jpeg/WGDklOIB-h6Nxb1KOBqm4uL7l37fEP2h3QXvJ90F7yc\"/><figcaption>2022年7月出席《七人樂隊》特別場。（微博@龔慈恩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"感情好。（微博@龔慈恩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821841611100160258637.jpeg/k1sv5ixLeYAwJ4vHVHdwI_hjLMcz2PD4m1Rs3ptUbN4\"/><figcaption>感情好。（微博@龔慈恩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"細仔。（微博@龔慈恩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821839522205696305749.jpeg/OPr2AJvR219mMxjsI3Iwn0th-q22UjXHXCziLVws4i0\"/><figcaption>細仔。（微博@龔慈恩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"細仔。（微博@龔慈恩）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20240607/875821843519639552425039.jpeg/fhwJhTSlVKUM0Hxf-m81L4vgkeiGPxWJeO3sRHjt7EQ\"/><figcaption>細仔。（微博@龔慈恩）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Addison畢業於加拿大頂尖高中Appleby College（IG@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210622/484058208978210816379281.jpeg/xLh1dYa-ySwGPTgH9SJhnin1RVkF4XA8rFTOhqxUzoY\"/><figcaption>Addison畢業於加拿大頂尖高中Appleby College（IG@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Addison細個面圓圓好可愛！（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210622/484058211100659712018523.jpeg/i8QOTgxQYCoj15Rl4z4AIVIvy5xKsImPqqQ-OKqkPjg\"/><figcaption>Addison細個面圓圓好可愛！（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好可愛！（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201118/405721580216913920549032.jpeg/cP1jRIIqNgcgATdARb9IP6XS0g1wYzBpoQl4WKEJeFg\"/><figcaption>好可愛！（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"愈大愈靚仔！（IG@kaening）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210622/484058213302800384786905.jpeg/Nz_MOLwRUqB7wmIyddeTqZGLbwGTcNf8gclRXYHJUV0\"/><figcaption>愈大愈靚仔！（IG@kaening）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好高。（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201231/421304645056073728695730.jpeg/uGICuCWjBI296tVsm_o-yawtgeyoOZOHS_a70kv2u9I\"/><figcaption>好高。（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"型仔！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201231/421304647308546048984312.jpeg/irDBksuZlSgZT7YQn25TAM1pm_rUYpHLeIicK3iInCs\"/><figcaption>型仔！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"型仔！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201231/421304649212891136038416.jpeg/mRD7MS9Tdtj8Hix5Y2kcluYus0bRZAim6UUhBulFIQY\"/><figcaption>型仔！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"型仔！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201231/421304650907521024485093.jpeg/7Scl4jTcnydE8y6XsNteuGhT72vK7S3Tk29LBJNvSwQ\"/><figcaption>型仔！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"支持！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201231/421304652895752192985431.jpeg/i-HoXQm_K2y0mnhhFBpcUEm32ArwJ0qrYAex3mAHsd4\"/><figcaption>支持！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"支持！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20201231/421304636029407232190274.jpeg/uUAbpT6NlaNKCjGSQyJDW_PqfNhEfixHe9zVynvc1co\"/><figcaption>支持！（Instagram影片截圖@kung_mimi）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T15:21:14.601277+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2023,"images":34,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:05:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T16:18:39.240080+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:18:40.368985+00:00","content_hash":"c0a6eb5c6fc68d653e3e101d9bad6222d23b3defa755b52c6798c59bebca4660","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}